@server = http://localhost:4004
@service = {{server}}/odata/v4/cash-sync

### Service Metadata
GET {{service}}/$metadata

### Read Payment Queue
GET {{service}}/Payments?$top=5&$expand=matches

### Read Match Results
GET {{service}}/MatchResult?$top=5

### Read Open Items
GET {{service}}/OpenItem?$top=5

### Validate Sample Remittance Advice (AI Pipeline)
POST {{service}}/validateSampleDocument
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Get AI Execution Statistics
GET {{service}}/getAiStatistics()
